# kin/child/hair/short: the child's Short hair: a round mop, the fringe (Cropped and Tousled too; Tousled adds kin/child/hair/tuft)
# The slice (P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY; to KIN-CHILD in wave 2). The child, 21 px (STYLE_P2 3). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body child
role hair short
role hair tousled
role hair cropped
layer hairFront
anchor head
keys rest

